Frequency: Event-driven; ~200–500 events/year
Volume: All employees; high-risk roles
Owner: Compliance Analyst
Participants: Compliance, Employee, Manager
Source: workflow W2938 — Gifts, Hospitality &amp; Entertainment Register &amp; Approval</bpmn:documentation>
