Responsible (R): Compliance Analyst
Accountable (A): Compliance Officer
Duration: Per event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2938_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2938_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
