Frequency: Event-driven
Volume: ~10–30 events/year (Philippine operating reality)
Owner: Compliance Officer
Participants: Compliance, Legal, Employee, Management
Source: workflow W2939 — Facilitation Payment, Solicitation &amp; Extortion Reporting</bpmn:documentation>
