      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Quarterly/Audit Committee cycle
Frequency: Quarterly + annual assurance
Volume: Enterprise-wide
Owner: Compliance Officer
Participants: Compliance, Internal Audit, Audit Committee
Source: workflow W2944 — ABC Program Assurance, Metrics &amp; Board Reporting</bpmn:documentation>
