      <bpmn:userTask id="W2944_Task6" name="Compliance compiles ABC program metrics: training completion, gift…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Compliance compiles ABC program metrics: training completion, gift declarations, solicitations reported, investigations, remediation
Responsible (R): Compliance Officer
Accountable (A): Compliance Officer
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2944_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2944_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2944_Task7" name="Internal Audit reviews ABC program effectiveness annually (W159 linkage)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Internal Audit reviews ABC program effectiveness annually (W159 linkage); validates controls; identifies gaps
Responsible (R): Internal Audit
Accountable (A): Audit Committee
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2944_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2944_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2944_Task8" name="Compliance reports program posture to Audit Committee/Board; recommends…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Compliance reports program posture to Audit Committee/Board; recommends enhancements; tracks commitments
Responsible (R): Compliance
Accountable (A): Audit Committee
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2944_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2944_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
